  "evidencia": "Page: Quality Cafe (diner). Sentence: The Quality Cafe (also known as Quality Diner) is a now-defunct diner at 1236 West 7th Street in Los Angeles, California.\nPage: Quality Cafe (diner). Sentence: The restaurant ceased to function as a diner in late 2006 but has appeared as a location featured in a number of Hollywood films, including \"Training Day\", \"Old School\", \"Se7en\", \"Ghost World\", \"Gone in 60 Seconds\", \"The Stepfather\", \"What's Love Got to Do with It\", \"Sex and Death 101\", and \"Catch Me If You Can.\"\nPage: Old School (film). Sentence: Old School is a 2003 American comedy film released by DreamWorks Pictures and The Montecito Picture Company and directed by Todd Phillips.",
